@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# Test list
+
+1. Materialize the finite operation-catalog package and exact source declarations.
+2. Bind every selected operation to one existing package and obligation reference.
+3. Reject malformed, duplicate, orphan, unknown-kind, missing-ref, and digest-drift inputs.
+4. Compile the same exact input twice to byte-identical catalog and manifest outputs.
+5. Bind source commit/tree, declarations, selected release, and output digests.
+6. Keep unselected declarations from changing selected output.
+7. Add a selected data row without changing edits source.
+8. Execute zero package, worker, shell, retry, cancel, or result-authority effects.
+9. Read zero mutable repository HEAD/latest references at compile or runtime.
+10. Produce output accepted by edits#118 WT-04's strict catalog consumer.
+11. Build and check the package through Nix from a clean clone.
+12. Keep all pre-existing ops checks Green with zero skip/waiver.
